         <p>In today's digital world, your <a data-preview="" href="https://www.google.com/search?ved=1t:260882&amp;q=how+to+build+professional+online+presence&amp;bbid=8491425780932094856&amp;bpid=9106828125350114165" target="_blank">online presence</a> is your professional reputation. A strong LinkedIn profile is non-negotiable. Fill out your profile completely, highlight your skills and accomplishments, and connect with professionals in your field. Use your platform to share insightful articles and thoughts on your industry. A well-maintained portfolio or personal website showcasing your projects is also a powerful way to demonstrate your skills. This is your personal brand—how you present yourself to the professional world. Make it count.</p>
 
